# Kelvins CDM dataset (CC-BY-4.0, safe to redistribute -- but train_data.csv
# alone is 232 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB hard per-file push limit, so it
# can't be committed directly despite the license allowing it. Fetch via
# scripts/download_kelvins.py instead; SOURCE.md (provenance/checksum) is
# the one file from this directory that IS tracked -- see docs/05-datasets.md
# and docs/12-architecture.md.
data/kelvins_cdm/*
!data/kelvins_cdm/SOURCE.md

